    {
      "text": "Turn on a multi-functional pressure cooker (such as Instant Pot) and select Yogurt function. Pour in coconut milk and sprinkle with pectin powder; mix until well dissolved. Stir in soy yogurt. Close and lock the lid. Set timer for 24 hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Unlock and remove lid. Stir yogurt well and transfer to sealed jars. Chill in the refrigerator for at least 6 hours.",
